--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Derived work: FlashInfer
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The SM90 decode kernel (`src/fosca/_sm90/`) and the paged-decode
wrapper (`src/fosca/wrapper.py`) are adapted from the CuTe DSL GQA
decode kernels and the paged-decode wrapper in FlashInfer
(https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer), which are licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. A copy of that license is the LICENSE file at the
root of this repository.

Changes from the upstream work: every decode path was replaced with a quantized
one; the paged K/V gather, the flash-decoding split-K reduction and the arch
dispatch were reimplemented; and the upstream API-logging decorator and SM-count
helper were replaced with local equivalents. The derived files therefore do not
track upstream and are not drop-in compatible with it.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Derived work: NVIDIA CUTLASS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

`src/fosca/_sm100/gqa_decode.py`, `src/fosca/_sm100/int_fold_decode.py`,
`src/fosca/_sm100/int_fold_asm.py` and `src/fosca/wrapper.py` are adapted from
the Hopper FMHA CuTeDSL example in NVIDIA CUTLASS
(https://github.com/NVIDIA/cutlass), which is licensed under the BSD 3-Clause
License, reproduced below. These four files carry NVIDIA's copyright notice.

Changes from the upstream work: the dense FMHA pipeline was replaced with a
quantized paged-decode pipeline. The dense SM90 decode kernel that the example
was originally adapted into was removed when the package became quantized-only,
so the modules listed above no longer track upstream and are not drop-in
compatible with it.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Redistributed: QuACK
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

`src/fosca/_vendor/quack/` redistributes a minimal subset of QuACK
(https://github.com/Dao-AILab/quack), BSD 3-Clause License.
Copyright (c) 2025, Wentao Guo, Ted Zadouri, Tri Dao.

Changes from the upstream work: internal imports were rewritten to the
`fosca._vendor` package path, and the package `__init__.py` files were
emptied so that importing the subset does not pull in the project's whole kernel
surface.

